# Project facts for agents

Every skill, subagent, and role in `.claude/` reads this file for project-specific
facts, so the rest of the kit stays the same across projects. When the project changes
shape (a new workspace, a new check), update this file first.

## Identity

- **Project:** {{ project_name }} (`{{ project_slug }}`)
- **Repository:** `{{ github_repository }}`
- **Base branch:** `develop`. Feature branches: `feature/<plan-name>` (planned work) or
  `fix/<name>`, `chore/<name>`. Never push to `develop`, `staging`, or `main`.
- **Issue tracker:** see [tracker.md](tracker.md) for every tracker operation.

## Workspaces

| Workspace | Path | Guide | Checks (run from the repo root) |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| API | `apps/backend/` | `apps/backend/docs/Agents.md` | `cd apps/backend && uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format --check . && uv run mypy && uv run lint-imports && uv run pytest` |
| Web app | `apps/frontend/` | `apps/frontend/docs/Agents.md` | `npm run lint && npm run typecheck -w @app/frontend && npm test -w @app/frontend && npm run build -w @app/frontend` |
| UI kit | `packages/ui-kit/` | `packages/ui-kit/docs/Agents.md` | `npm run typecheck -w @app/ui-kit && npm test -w @app/ui-kit && npm run test:stories -w @app/ui-kit` |
| Shared TS | `packages/shared/` | `packages/shared/docs/Agents.md` | `npm run typecheck -w @app/shared && npm test -w @app/shared` |
| AWS templates | `apps/backend/template.yaml`, `apps/backend/infra/`, `apps/frontend/template.yaml`, `infra/` | `docs/architecture.md` | `uvx cfn-lint==1.57.1 apps/backend/template.yaml apps/backend/infra/*.yaml apps/frontend/template.yaml infra/*.yaml` |
| Docs | `docs/`, `**/docs/`, `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md` | `docs/README.md` | none |

Integration tests need Postgres: `docker compose up -d db` and
`TEST_DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://app:app@localhost:5432/app_test`.
After any API change run `npm run gen:api` and commit `apps/backend/openapi.json` and
`apps/frontend/src/core/api/schema.d.ts`.

**Full check suite** (the "integration gate"):

```bash
npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm test
npm run test:stories -w @app/ui-kit
(cd apps/backend && uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format --check . && uv run mypy \
  && uv run lint-imports && uv run pytest)
npm run gen:api && git diff --exit-code
npm run build
```

